        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-487 (ensure controlled execution — KYC, Customer Due Diligence &amp; PEP/Sanctions Screening (PA-86.1).) | - operational: UBO identification and screening
Owner: Procurement Compliance Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
