    <bpmn:process id="W_W2924" name="W2924. Sanctions &amp; Watchlist Screening (UN/OFAC/EU/AMLC/INTERPOL)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Onboarding + continuous re-screening against updated lists
Frequency: Continuous (list updates) + daily batch
Volume: All customers/vendors + payment parties
Owner: Compliance Analyst
Participants: Compliance, IT, Treasury
Source: workflow W2924 — Sanctions &amp; Watchlist Screening (UN/OFAC/EU/AMLC/INTERPOL)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2924_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2924_Lane1" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2924_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2924_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2924_Lane2" name="Compliance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2924_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2924_Lane3" name="Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2924_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2924_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2924_Start5" name="Onboarding + continuous re-screening against updated lists">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2924_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2924_Task6" name="IT maintains sanctions screening engine with UN, OFAC, EU, AMLC, and other…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: IT maintains sanctions screening engine with UN, OFAC, EU, AMLC, and other watchlists; runs daily batch and real-time screening
Responsible (R): IT
Accountable (A): Compliance Officer
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2924_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2924_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2924_Task7" name="Compliance reviews potential matches (fuzzy-match triage); confirms true…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Compliance reviews potential matches (fuzzy-match triage); confirms true positive vs. false positive; escalates true positive
Responsible (R): Compliance Analyst
Accountable (A): Compliance Officer
Duration: Per match</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2924_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2924_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2924_Task8" name="On confirmed match, Compliance blocks transaction/relationship; files STR with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: On confirmed match, Compliance blocks transaction/relationship; files STR with AMLC; freezes assets per sanctions requirement
Responsible (R): Compliance
