        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compliance captures and documents customer/vendor consent for KYC data collection, use, and AMLC reporting per Data Privacy Act
Responsible (R): Compliance
Accountable (A): Compliance Officer
Duration: Per onboarding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2928_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2928_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
