Responsible (R): DPO
Accountable (A): Compliance Officer
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2928_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2928_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
